    <briefdescription>
<para>Maps ONNX primitive type name strings to TensorProto::DataType values. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Supports all scalar element types such as &quot;float&quot;, &quot;int64&quot;, &quot;bfloat16&quot;, and the low-precision types &quot;float8e4m3fn&quot;, &quot;uint4&quot;, &quot;float4e2m1&quot;, etc. </para>
